      "type": "intro",
      "text": "Payments (Service Initiation)\n\nThe Payment Service Initiation capabilities allow customers to authorise payments at their LFI which a TPP then submits within the bounds of that authorisation. Payment types range from one-time instant payments through to long-running multi-payment consents with variable amounts, schedules, or delegated authentication.",
