    {
      "id": "ed270305-4d05-5332-ae2f-16770d2d6914",
      "document_id": "tech/lfi-api-hub/v2.2-rc2/banking/service-initiation",
      "type": "section",
      "text": "Payments (Service Initiation) > Bank Service Initiation Provider\n\nAccess to the Payment Service Initiation APIs requires TPPs to hold the BSIP role. The API Hub validates the role on every request before proxying it to the LFI. If the consent also includes data-sharing permissions ( ReadAccountsBasic, ReadAccountsDetail, ReadBalances ), TPPs additionally require the BDSP role.",
